    <string name="dash_definitions">How it is counted: a message is one e-mail; a transaction is a conversation. Response time runs from receiving a message to the first reply sent from the same account in the same conversation (a reply that answers it directly takes priority). Only messages and replies handled through this app are known to it, so a reply written elsewhere is not counted. Message counts come from the mail server by calendar day. Nothing on this page is sample data.</string>
