    <string name="backup_scope_title">What a backup contains</string>
    <string name="backup_scope_body">Administrative data only: tasks and their history, the official register, follow-up reminders and the message references they use. It does NOT contain e-mail messages, attachments, passwords or account settings; mail stays on the mail server. Backups are encrypted with your passphrase. Without the passphrase they cannot be opened, and it cannot be recovered, so keep it safe. Copies kept on this device are deleted if the app is uninstalled: export a copy to a safe place.</string>
